{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function hashKey(queryKey: readonly unknown[]): string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/utils.ts#L323","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/utils.ts:323"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Default query & mutation keys hash function.\nHashes the value into a stable hash."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"querykey","children":[{"type":"text","value":"queryKey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"readonly "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The query or mutation key to hash."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The stable hash of the key, as a JSON string."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// Object keys are sorted, so key order doesn't affect the hash:\nhashKey(['todos', { page: 1, filter: 'done' }]) // === '[\"todos\",{\"filter\":\"done\",\"page\":1}]'","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"querykey","text":"queryKey","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction hashKey(queryKey: readonly unknown[]): string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/utils.ts:323](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/utils.ts#L323)\n\nDefault query & mutation keys hash function.\nHashes the value into a stable hash.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### queryKey\n\nreadonly `unknown`[]\n\nThe query or mutation key to hash.\n\n## Returns\n\n`string`\n\nThe stable hash of the key, as a JSON string.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n// Object keys are sorted, so key order doesn't affect the hash:\nhashKey(['todos', { page: 1, filter: 'done' }]) // === '[\"todos\",{\"filter\":\"done\",\"page\":1}]'\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: hashKey\ntitle: hashKey\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction hashKey(queryKey: readonly unknown[]): string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/utils.ts:323](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/utils.ts#L323)\n\nDefault query & mutation keys hash function.\nHashes the value into a stable hash.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### queryKey\n\nreadonly `unknown`[]\n\nThe query or mutation key to hash.\n\n## Returns\n\n`string`\n\nThe stable hash of the key, as a JSON string.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n// Object keys are sorted, so key order doesn't affect the hash:\nhashKey(['todos', { page: 1, filter: 'done' }]) // === '[\"todos\",{\"filter\":\"done\",\"page\":1}]'\n```\n"}
